[{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0000","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0010","text":"早上好\n起得真早啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0011","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0020","text":"咦？\n难道，你是跑过来的吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0030","text":"不行吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0040","text":"不，我是觉得真不愧是路加\n真是练习热情啊……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0050","text":"这种程度很正常吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0060","text":"嗯，是吗……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0070","text":"话说回来，真是个舒服的早晨啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0080","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0090","text":"空气也好，景色也好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0100","text":"啊，你知道吗？\n听说附近还有绝景景点"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0101","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0110","text":"…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0120","text":"好像也有跑步路线来着……\n要不要去看看？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0130","text":"哈…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0140","text":"嗯？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0150","text":"谁要去…………？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0160","text":"啊，是吗……两个人去太浪费了\n叫上羽那和阳希一起去怎么样？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0170","text":"…………野餐吗"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0171","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s09_01012600_02_0180","text":"……哈哈……果然不行吗……"}]
